If a creature you control that entered this turn would deal damage, it deals twice that much damage instead."""@en ;
    :flavorText """Scales streaked with lightning, trailing thunder in his wake, Neriv is the living banner around which the Mardu rally."""@en ;
    :gathererUrl "https://gatherer.wizards.com/Pages/Card/Details.aspx?multiverseid=693690"^^xsd:anyURI ;
